    "notes": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>FULL NAME</strong>: Anya Zomorova</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>ROLE</strong>: Wherever she wants, former diver</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>AGE</strong>: 71</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>PERSONALITY</strong>: Babushka</p>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\"><hr></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>ATTRIBUTES</strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>STRENGTH</strong>: 2<br><strong>AGILITY</strong>: 2<br><strong>WITS</strong>: 4<br><strong>EMPATHY</strong>: 4</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>HEALTH</strong>: 2</p>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\"><hr></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>SKILLS</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<p><strong>Heavy Machinery</strong>: 2</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<p><strong>Manipulation</strong>: 2</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<p><strong>Medical Aid</strong>: 1</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<p><strong>Observation</strong>: 1</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<p><strong>Survival</strong>: 1</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<p><strong>Comtech</strong>: 3</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\"><hr></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>TALENTS</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<p><strong>Compassion</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\"><hr></div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>BUDDY</strong>: Everyone<br><strong>RIVAL</strong>: Li Qiang</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>SIGNATURE ITEM</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<p>Team photo</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\"><hr></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>ITEMS</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<p>Homemade vodka</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\"><hr></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>Backstory</strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\"Anya has been serving at this station for over 45 years. She met her husband here, her daughter was born here, and she knows the station like no one else.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">However, Anya doesn&rsquo;t love the station itself; she loves the people in it.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">When the time came to retire, she didn&rsquo;t want to leave. She decided to stay, and her request was granted.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Babushka doesn&rsquo;t cause trouble and is the main reason why morale at the station isn&rsquo;t worse. That, and the vodka she makes herself.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">She lost her husband 20 years ago to a heart attack and her daughter in the border war 2 years ago. Since then, her attachment to the station's residents has become her sole motivation.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">In her attempt to find Karill, she exhausted herself during a 6-hour trek outside the base. She no longer believes he is alive but wanted at least to find his body.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Now, she believes the station is haunted by evil spirits from her childhood stories&mdash;called <em>Vodyanoy</em>&mdash;malicious water spirits who want to drown humans as vengeance for the wrongs caused by war and humanity.\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>",
    "adhocitems": "<p>Vodka</p>"
  },
